## Style: a website

Design this like a well-made website rather than an app panel: a confident layout with
real hierarchy, generous space, and type and colour of its own. Scrolling is fine. Do
not imitate Hive's chrome, and do not use the `--hv-*` variables unless they help.
{{end -}}
{{if eq .Style "reference"}}
## Style: make it feel like this

The user wants it to feel like: {{.Reference}}

Work out what gives that its character (layout, density, type, colour, motion, tone of
the words) and build on those decisions. Evoke it rather than copy its logo or branding.
{{end -}}
